  "summary": {
    "text": "Student life at IIT (ISM) Dhanbad runs through the Students' Gymkhana, whose Science & Technology, Sports & Games and Media & Culture wings back technical, cultural, literary and media clubs plus a separate Entrepreneurship Cell. The fest calendar centres on the tech festival Concetto every October, alongside the cultural fest Srijan, techno-mining fest Khannan and sports fest Parakram. Day-to-day recreation runs through the Sports and Physical Education Centre, whose grounds and courts cover most major sports plus a 50 m pool and gymnasium.",
